      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 512,
        "height": 464,
        "content": "## Receive and Extrect AI Question & Answer\n\nIt receives the user’s question and the AI-generated answer that needs to be checked and organizes the question and answer from the input data so it can be used in the next steps."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "29da2ae7-39b3-4b3e-981b-3173aa1a76d6",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1120,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 496,
        "height": 464,
        "content": "## Real-Time Web Research & Result Preparation for AI Validation\n\nThis step searches the question on Google and collects real-time information. It then filters and formats the most relevant results so the AI can easily compare them and verify the accuracy of the answer."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "dfe1679b-c854-419e-91d2-6c7f85def22a",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1664,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 912,
        "height": 464,
        "content": "## AI Verification, Risk Analysis & Decision Engine\n\nThis step uses AI to verify whether the given answer is correct by comparing it with real-time search results. It then calculates a confidence score and classifies the response as SAFE, SUSPICIOUS, or HALLUCINATED. After that, it converts the AI output into a structured format and decides what action should be taken based on the risk level."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "db7bab96-7ee1-41a8-9bdf-de71dc0efe35",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2656,
        448
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 272,
        "content": "If the answer looks suspicious, a message is sent to the team on Slack for manual review."
